# ── Not part of the build: never versioned ──
# Only what is needed to BUILD is versioned. Docs, notes, mockups and local
# tooling scripts (.bat/.ps1…) stay out of the repository.
# Local tool state, caches, scratch areas (never versioned; every hidden
# folder is also caught by ".*/" below, every *.md by "*.md")
.cache/
.local*/
scratch*/
# Any other hidden folder (editor/tool caches, secrets): never versioned.
.*/
# Docs / notes / planning / mockups
/docs/
/docs-*/
doc/
/Mockups/
mockup*.html
*.md
!/README.md
*.markdown
*.txt
*.rtf
*.docx
*.pdf
